---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Mental Health | AOC, Calgary";
const description = "Explore mental health and wellbeing topics, from emotional distress to life changes and relationships.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
<main id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="wrap"><section class="page-head"><div class="eyebrow">Mental health & wellbeing</div><h1>There is space<br>for what you’re carrying.</h1><p class="lead">You do not have to arrive with a perfectly clear explanation of how you feel.</p></section><div class="content-grid"><div class="prose"><h2>Understanding your<br>experience in context.</h2><p>Work, relationships, identity, expectations, and life changes can all shape the concerns you bring to counselling. The conversation begins with what feels important to you.</p><h3>Areas you might want to discuss</h3><ul><li>Feeling overwhelmed, worried, or stuck</li><li>Low mood, motivation, or a sense of disconnection</li><li>Changes in relationships and boundaries</li><li>Loss, uncertainty, or a new chapter of life</li><li>Self-understanding and patterns you want to change</li></ul><h3>A shared direction</h3><p>Useful goals can be concrete and personal: understanding a recurring pattern, communicating a need, or responding differently to a difficult situation. Service suitability and scope will be discussed before beginning.</p><a class="text-link" href="/approach/">Read about the approach ↗</a></div><aside class="side-box"><h3>Information can help you orient</h3><p>The resource library offers general information from Canadian organizations. It is a starting point for learning, rather than an assessment of your individual needs.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Consultation details ↗</a></aside></div></div></main>
</Layout>
